  "description": "Say hello to “Stay Howdy!” Envision a fusion of contemporary rounded edges and the timeless aesthetic of Western slab serif elements: this font emerges as a distinctive, amiable and character-filled style. Ideal for lending a “Retro-Meets-Quirky” essence to design exploits, Stay Howdy! takes out any hint of rigidness or antiquated vibe. From inspiring quotes and apparel such as t-shirts and hoodies, to drinkware like mugs, greetings cards, posters, and accessories including hats and key chains, as well as stickers, packaging materials, invitation cards, and even pillows—Stay Howdy! brings a fresh yet nostalgic flair across a wide variety of mediums!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Say hello to “Stay Howdy!” Envision a fusion of contemporary rounded edges and the timeless aesthetic of Western slab serif elements: this font emerges as a distinctive, amiable and character-filled style. Ideal for lending a “Retro-Meets-Quirky” essence to design exploits, Stay Howdy! takes out any hint of rigidness or antiquated vibe. From inspiring quotes and apparel such as t-shirts and hoodies, to drinkware like mugs, greetings cards, posters, and accessories including hats and key chains, as well as stickers, packaging materials, invitation cards, and even pillows—Stay Howdy! brings a fresh yet nostalgic flair across a wide variety of mediums!</p>",
